# PPSA16901: EULA gate, then select the ring's default item ("Lara's Home",
# TR1's playable mansion level) on the Tomb Raider I title screen.
#
# WHICH GAME THIS ARRIVES IN HAS CHANGED. When TOMB_RAIDER_STATUS.md was written (2026-08) this
# file arrived on Tomb Raider II, three runs of three. On 2026-10-06 it arrives on Tomb Raider I,
# on every build tried back to the v0.2.2 release. Tomb Raider I's home rendered as exploded geometry
# until #4637 was fixed and renders now; for Tomb Raider II's use reach-tr2-laras-home.pad.
# The ring is a 5-item cycle; its "Game" item is New Game (reach-fmv.pad selects it). Lara's Home
# is the default item, so this is the shortest route from a default launch to a real playable level.
6-14:down
16-18:cross
44-46:cross
52-54:cross
